# PondCo — Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Deliberate rules only. There is deliberately NO /* catch-all: Pages'
# validator ignores splat -> /index.html rules as infinite loops, and with
# dist/404.html present (scripts/generate-404.mjs) unmatched paths are
# served 404.html with a genuine 404 status.
# NOTE (2026-11-22 rebase): /books is a real generated static page now
# (33fd25a), so it needs NO rewrite — a rewrite would shadow the file.
/ /home 200
/privacy-policy /privacy 301
